<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Impact Capital VC — AI 观点</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/</link><description>Impact Capital VC 关于风险投资、AI 浪潮与智能体 AI 崛起的分析。</description><language>zh-Hans</language><item><title>黄仁勋事件调查：对 AI 行业可能意味着什么</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/nvidia-ceo-investigation-ai-industry-impact/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/nvidia-ceo-investigation-ai-industry-impact/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>英伟达董事会在 CEO 黄仁勋承认婚外情后对其展开调查。我们评估其对 AI 行业在关键人物、出口管制和供应链方面的影响。</description></item><item><title>AI 资本超级周期：风险投资究竟流向何处</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/ai-capital-supercycle-venture-funding/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/ai-capital-supercycle-venture-funding/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>AI 正主导风险投资。我们梳理资金流向——基础设施、模型与应用——并解释为何应用层被低估。</description></item><item><title>为什么智能体 AI 是风险投资的下一个前沿</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/why-agentic-ai-is-the-next-venture-frontier/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/why-agentic-ai-is-the-next-venture-frontier/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>聊天机器人回答问题，智能体完成工作。本文解释智能体 AI 为何改变软件经济学，以及投资者应关注什么。</description></item><item><title>超越基础模型：在应用层构筑护城河</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/application-layer-moats-beyond-foundation-models/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/application-layer-moats-beyond-foundation-models/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>如果人人都能调用同一个模型，防御力从何而来？答案是数据、工作流深度以及在非传统细分市场的渠道。</description></item><item><title>算力经济学：不断下降的推理成本如何重塑 AI 初创公司</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/compute-economics-ai-startups/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/compute-economics-ai-startups/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>推理越来越便宜，而前沿训练越来越昂贵。这种分化对初创公司的利润率和战略意味着什么。</description></item><item><title>从搜索到答案：GEO 与 AEO 作为新的风险投资赛道</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/from-search-to-answers-geo-aeo-venture-opportunity/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/from-search-to-answers-geo-aeo-venture-opportunity/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>当人们向 AI 助手提问而不再搜索时，品牌需要生成式引擎优化和答案引擎优化。这为何是一个新市场。</description></item><item><title>AI 热潮中的估值纪律：过往周期的启示</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/valuation-discipline-in-the-ai-boom/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/valuation-discipline-in-the-ai-boom/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Mar 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>每一次技术热潮都会诞生持久的巨头，也会造成代价高昂的错误。我们如何在投资 AI 时保持纪律。</description></item><item><title>亚洲 AI 走廊：为什么新加坡是智能体初创公司的发射台</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/singapore-asia-ai-corridor-venture/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/singapore-asia-ai-corridor-venture/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Feb 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>新加坡兼具科研深度、监管清晰度以及通往多元亚洲市场的渠道——这是智能体 AI 公司的理想条件。</description></item><item><title>科学家创始人：为什么研究者能打造最好的智能体 AI 公司</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/scientist-founders-agentic-ai/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/scientist-founders-agentic-ai/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 09 Dec 2025 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>经同行评审的研究正在成为商业优势。为什么我们寻找既发表论文又交付产品的创始人。</description></item><item><title>面向中小企业的智能体 AI：自动化跨境增长</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/agentic-ai-smes-cross-border-commerce/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/agentic-ai-smes-cross-border-commerce/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 21 Oct 2025 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>中小企业可能是 AI 智能体的最大受益者。智能体如何成为企业的营销和出口部门。</description></item><item><title>将负责任的 AI 作为投资标准</title><link>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/responsible-ai-governance-investment-criterion/</link><guid>https://impact-capital.vc/zh/perspectives/responsible-ai-governance-investment-criterion/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 16 Sep 2025 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>治理、透明度和隐私不只是合规成本。为什么我们将负责任的 AI 视为长期价值的来源。</description></item></channel></rss>